	<!--Name of the mod to display to players-->
	<DisplayName Value="Modular Growables" />
	<!--Short description of the mod-->
	<ShortDescription Value="Experimental wider growables assembled from vanilla building modules." />
	<!--Long description of the mod. Single line or multi line. Supports minimal markdown subset-->
	<!--LongDescription Value="This is a long description" /-->
	<LongDescription>
Adds one experimental wider low-density residential growable by combining two compatible vanilla building prefabs. It reuses vanilla meshes and retains the base building's simulation components. This technical preview has not yet passed in-game testing; appearance, zoning, simulation behavior, and save/load stability are unverified. No custom or AI-generated assets are included.
	</LongDescription>
